::: flashcard
How to invoke a function in rocq?
=== key
Subexpression: `(fn arg1 arg2 ...)`

Top-level: `Compute (fn arg1 arg2 ...).`

Expectation: `Example test: (fn arg1 arg2) = res.`
:::
